> Bash /usr/local/bin/repo-looper --repo tacplus --issue 627 --checkpoint "Resolved the memberport conflict with main 57292992 (#919). Took main's retry on longer tokens and dropped this branch's tokenless warm-up stream: main's retry covers the same cold-open case, and the warm-up was the one part of this...
